#X text 330 650 in your own patch send any value from 0 to 1 to [s c1] as: data 0.7. for a csv series scale it to the range 0 to 1 first. [tessera/datamod~] does that for you and its data outlet can be connected straight to the inlet of any tessera effect, f 70;
